-- A CONSIDER over text. Each WHEN would be one condition, but the report
-- writes the conditions for a solver that cannot read text, so the rule is
-- not covered, the reason says why, and the run exits 3.
GIVEN colour IS A STRING
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fee by colour` colour IS
    CONSIDER colour
    WHEN "red" THEN 5
    WHEN "blue" THEN 9
    OTHERWISE 20
